                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "16253ea7-d1d8-46f2-a77e-1815ee0df3cf",
                                "sense_id": "f7c45377-6107-31e7-b536-daf9475f1409",
                                "text": "Дед, поуча́я меня́, то́же говори́л, что бог — существо́ вездесу́щее, всеве́дущее, всеви́дящее, до́брая по́мощь лю́дям во всех дела́х, но моли́лся он не так, как ба́бушка.",
                                "translation": "Grandfather used to teach me that God was all-seeing, all-knowing and present everywhere, that he was a help to people in their daily lives. But he didn’t pray like Grandmother.",
                                "english": "Grandfather used to teach me that God was all-seeing, all-knowing and present everywhere, that he was a help to people in their daily lives. But he didn’t pray like Grandmother."
                            }
                        ]
